# Yaegi WASM artifacts: intentionally NOT ignored. They ship with
# the repo so Vercel deploys them without needing a Go toolchain in
# the build image. Regenerate locally via `pnpm runtime:build` after
# any change to runtime/yaegi-wasm/. ~11 MB raw / ~1.9 MB brotli on
# the wire. Migrate to a Vercel build hook (custom container with
# Go) when the size starts to bite or strict-fresh builds become
# valuable.


